# BFF — Recurring schedule approval (M23-S05, UC-071)
# STAFF|MANAGER only. A pass-through to the backend routes of the same name; every decision
# (hold window, re-check of the whole term, materialization) is made backend-side.
#
# Prerequisites:
#   1. pnpm infra:up
#   2. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run migration:run
#   3. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run seed
#   4. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run dev
#   5. pnpm --filter @ikaro/bff run dev
#   6. ENABLE_DEV_AUTH=true in apps/bff/.env.local
#
# REST Client environment: select "local" in VS Code status bar

@staffToken = {{staffLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

###
# @name staffLogin
POST {{bffUrl}}/v1/auth/dev-login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "staff@lavacar.com.br", "tenantSlug": "{{tenantSlug}}", "type": "staff" }

###

### Create for a customer — a bundle (TD49 Story 0): one "resourceSelections" entry per
### CUSTOMER_CHOICE requirement (here the staff member); the room is resolved per occurrence.
### 201 {id, status, approvalHoldExpiresAt} · 409 lists every colliding occurrence · 422 when a
### requirement needs a pick that is missing. A service with only automatic requirements, or the
### default shape, sends no "resourceSelections" at all.
POST {{bffUrl}}/v1/recurring-booking-schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serviceId": "{{bundleServiceId}}",
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "recurrence": {
    "frequency": "WEEKLY",
    "daysOfWeek": ["tuesday"],
    "startTime": "10:00",
    "durationMinutes": 60
  },
  "resourceSelections": [{ "resourceType": "STAFF", "resourceId": "{{staffResourceId}}" }],
  "startsOn": "2026-10-20",
  "endsOn": "2026-12-15"
}

###

### Pending requests — the approval queue
GET {{bffUrl}}/v1/recurring-booking-schedules?status=PENDING_APPROVAL
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

###

### One schedule by id (M23-S42) → 200 the list-item shape with "serviceName"; a customer token
### gets 404 for a schedule that is not theirs
GET {{bffUrl}}/v1/recurring-booking-schedules/{{pendingScheduleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

###

### Approve — 200 {id, status: "ACTIVE", occurrenceCount}
POST {{bffUrl}}/v1/recurring-booking-schedules/{{pendingScheduleId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

###

### Reject — 200 {id, status: "CANCELLED"}
POST {{bffUrl}}/v1/recurring-booking-schedules/{{pendingScheduleId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

###

### 409 — already resolved or past its hold (BOOKING_RECURRING_SCHEDULE_NOT_PENDING_APPROVAL)
POST {{bffUrl}}/v1/recurring-booking-schedules/{{resolvedScheduleId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

###

### End a schedule early — 200 {id, status: "CANCELLED", cancelledBookingIds[]}; cancels every future occurrence (UC-070 A2).
### A CUSTOMER ends their own; STAFF|MANAGER may end any schedule of the tenant.
POST {{bffUrl}}/v1/recurring-booking-schedules/{{activeScheduleId}}/end
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
